{
  "title": "Kissed Salty Thai Chicken Gaeng Curry",
  "description": "A salty, fluffy, and crowd-pleasing Thai dish featuring whole wheat and tagine-cooked chicken in a satvik-friendly gaeng curry form.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
